critical tasks: anticipation, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership. Concerns are attitude but can be mitigated with training.\n\nThus we can state recommendation for Candidate A, referencing strengths and concerns.\n\nWe need to include explicit facts: \"anticipate dangerous situations\", \"excellent spatial vision\", \"very good leadership qualities\". Also mention concerns: \"regarded as a show-off\", \"not open to new ideas\". Explain implications.\n\nProceed."}
